# label: alg:ch60-reader
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch60.tex:74
# caption: Validate an object before exposing its references to layout or relocation.

REQUIRE file byte buffer with known length
ENSURE validated sections, symbols, and relocation-table links
check ELF identification, target profile, header widths, and table bounds
FORALL section headers DO
  validate size, alignment, file extent where present, and supported allocated semantics
END FOR
validate section-name strings through the designated string table
locate one symbol table and validate its entry and string-table contracts
FORALL symbol entries DO
  validate binding, type, visibility, index, and defining extent
END FOR
FORALL RELA sections DO
  validate symbol-table link, target-section index, entry width, and count
END FOR

